tcome without observed); refusal (a refusal with an outcome other than refused or failed, or refused or failed without one); source (desired without observed; converged with baseline; reverted with desired); in_force (in_force with a source other than desired, or with failed; or converged with desired and no in_force or one that is not observed, its revision compared as an integer; 0.2, F-165); revision_on_revert (reverted with a revision in observed); last_known (last_known true without observed; false is absent, 0.2, F-165)."
